# TUSKWIND: the terns are Burl's lives. Each of the six lighthouses keeps
# one, and it flies off with him as soon as he lands anywhere on its islet
# (the bar shows it). A fall into the sea with a tern in hand: it carries
# him back to the islet he last jumped from, and whatever he passes on
# that ride back he picks up. With none, Burl wakes up and the journey is
# over: back to the title, records kept.
game tuskwind
wait 20
cheat seed 5
cheat journey
wait 2
expect count_6 == 6
cheat blank
cheat plat 220 200 60 0
cheat spawn 6 270 200
wait 2
expect terns == 0
expect thing_plat_6 == 1
# landing at the far end of its islet will do
cheat land 1
cheat place 1 224
wait 1
expect terns == 1
expect terns_found == 1
expect thing_state_6 == 1
# only once
hold LEFT 30
hold RIGHT 60
expect terns == 1
# off the end into the sea
cheat aim 30
cheat face 1
wait 2
hold A 40
wait 1
expect mode == 1
expect takeoff == 1
waituntil ps == 8 300
expect terns == 1
# a whelk half way along the ride back: it is his
cheat spawnpath 1 0.5
expect shells == 0
waituntil ps == 0 120
expect shells == 4
expect terns == 0
expect terns_used == 1
expect rescues == 1
expect plat == 1
expect mode == 0
# no tern this time
wait 2
hold A 40
wait 1
waituntil ps == 9 300
expect terns == 0
waituntil state == 7 200
expect save_terns == 1
expect paused == 0
wait 60
press A
wait 2
expect state == 0
